    "description": "Appeals for re-scrutiny of 2025 Scholarship Exam results accepted from tomorrow",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/112290/appeals-for-re-scrutiny-of-2025-scholarship-exam-results-accepted-from-tomorrow",
    "lang": "en",
