    "description": "SC sets Feb. 2026 date to hear petitions against Ranil\u2019s Deshabandu IGP appointment",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/SC-sets-Feb-2026-date-to-hear-petitions-against-Ranil-s-Deshabandu-IGP-appointment/56-781416",
    "lang": "en",
