    "description": "Ten people killed, 61 hurt after train hits double-decker bus in Mexico",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/112315/ten-people-killed-61-hurt-after-train-hits-double-decker-bus-in-mexico",
    "lang": "en",
