    "description": "Engineers urged to lead Sri Lanka\u2019s industrial transformation at IESL NEC 2025",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Engineers-urged-to-lead-Sri-Lanka-s-industrial-transformation-at-IESL-NEC-2025/34-781462",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
