    "description": "No student will face injustice at Gampaha Wickramarachchi Uni \u2013 PM",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/112341/no-student-will-face-injustice-at-gampaha-wickramarachchi-uni-pm",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
