    "description": "Trump calls on EU to impose 100% tariff on China and India to pressure Putin",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/112351/trump-calls-on-eu-to-impose-100-tariff-on-china-and-india-to-pressure-putin",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
