    "date_str": "2025-09-10",
    "description": "Sri Lanka made remarkable progress towards economic stabilization since the crisis: World Bank",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/112367/sri-lanka-made-remarkable-progress-towards-economic-stabilization-since-the-crisis-world-bank",
    "lang": "en",
