    "chunk_text": "An academic as well as a practitioner, Dr. Kiriella holds a PhD in Economics from the University of Colombo, with his research focused on Tourism FDI. He also holds an LLM (with Distinction), an MA and BA (Honours) in Economics from the University of Colombo, and an LLB from the Open University of Sri Lanka.\n\nEducated at S. Thomas\u2019 College, Mount Lavinia, D. S. Senanayake College, Colombo, and Ferguson Boys\u2019 Primary School, Ratnapura, Dr. Kiriella\u2019s journey reflects a blend of discipline, academic excellence, and professional dedication.\n\nThis honour at the Apex Awards highlights not only his individual achievements but also his broader contribution to Sri Lanka\u2019s tourism, professionalism, and sustainable growth.\n\nBritish national honoured for heroic efforts in Ella bus tragedy\n\nCentral Bank inaugurates \u201cFinancial Literacy Month 2025\u201d from September 10\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
