    "description": "Dialog and MDF renew partnership to expand Govi Mithuru with AI and inclusive farming solutions",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Dialog-and-MDF-renew-partnership-to-expand-Govi-Mithuru-with-AI-and-inclusive-farming-solutions/34-781485",
    "lang": "en",
