    "description": "PickMe expands into entertainment and lifestyle: Launches QR ticketing for events",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/PickMe-expands-into-entertainment-and-lifestyle-Launches-QR-ticketing-for-events/34-781486",
    "lang": "en",
