    "description": "Eurasia rising, Anura\u2019s SCO absence, strategic-security blindness, and NPP-Israel axis",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Eurasia-rising-Anura-s-SCO-absence-strategic-security-blindness-and-NPP-Israel-axis/4-781503",
