    "chunk_text": "Sterling Steels named Official Roofing Partner of CONSTRUCT 2025\n\nSterling Steels (Pvt) Ltd, a member of the E.B. Creasy Group and a leading provider of premium steel roofing solutions in Sri Lanka, is proud to announce its role as the Official Roofing Partner of CONSTRUCT 2025, the flagship construction industry exhibition organized by the National Construction Association of Sri Lanka (NCASL). Sterling Steels, formerly BlueScope Lysaght, brings over three decades of expertise in manufacturing advanced, durable, and sustainable roofing solutions. Backed by the 146-year legacy of its parent company, E.B. Creasy, the brand has consistently championed innovation and customer-centric practices that meet the evolving needs of Sri Lanka\u2019s construction sector.\n\nSterling Steels aims to showcase its latest architectural designs and technologies, while creating opportunities for meaningful dialogue and collaboration among architects, engineers, contractors, consultants, and corporate leaders. The company\u2019s presence at CONSTRUCT 2025 underscores its commitment to advancing sustainable building practices, promoting eco-conscious product innovation, and strengthening industry networks that fuel long-term growth.\n\nSampath Bank crowned as the Best Bank for ESG in Sri Lanka by Euromoney\n\nADB powers digital health revolution, bringing specialised care to rural communities\u2019 doorstep\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
