    "description": "CP Radhakrishnan sworn in as India\u2019s 15th Vice President",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/112424/cp-radhakrishnan-sworn-in-as-indias-15th-vice-president",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
