    "description": "Govt\u2019s policy to ensure every rupee is directed towards most productive investments \u2013 President at apparel sector pre-budget discussion",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/112430/govts-policy-to-ensure-every-rupee-is-directed-towards-most-productive-investments-president-at-apparel-sector-pre-budget-discussion",
