    "md5": "b7075b0f10061312cec3a53b9498dc8e",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1722,
    "chunk_text": "Hayleys Fentons, Hayleys Electronics achieve AEO Tier 1 Certification from Sri Lanka Customs\n\nHayleys Fentons Ltd., and Hayleys Electronics Ltd., have secured the Authorised Economic Operator (AEO) Tier I status, officially awarded by Sri Lanka Customs recently.\n\nThis globally recognised certification, established under the World Customs Organisation\u2019s SAFE Framework of Standards, highlights both companies\u2019 unwavering commitment to supply chain excellence, regulatory compliance and operational integrity in international trade.\n\nSecuring AEO Tier I status required meeting stringent eligibility standards covering legal compliance, governance discipline and supply chain security. This recognition reflects the companies\u2019 long-standing culture of operational integrity and accountability, underpinned by the governance principles upheld across the Hayleys Group.\n\nHayleys Fentons Ltd., Managing Director Hasith Prematillake stated, \u201cThis achievement is a result of the relentless commitment and expertise of our teams in meeting rigorous international trade requirements. With accelerated clearance protocols and streamlined regulatory procedures now in place, we are positioned to enhance operational performance and deliver superior value to our clients and partners.\u201d\n\n\u201cThe certification strengthens cooperative relationships with international trade partners. It also reinforces our governance framework, elevates staff confidence and sharpens procedural clarity, further minimising compliance risks. With these standards in place, we are strategically positioned to pursue and achieve AEO Top Tier 2 certification in the future,\u201d added Hayleys Fentons General Manager \u2013 Supply Chain Ruwan Kumara."
