    "description": "EFL delivers seamless logistics for Richardson Serendib 5 MW solar power plant",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/EFL-delivers-seamless-logistics-for-Richardson-Serendib-5-MW-solar-power-plant/34-781621",
    "lang": "en",
