    "chunk_text": "Abeywardena\u2019s claim that some local and foreign individuals hatched a plot to plunge this country into anarchy has gone unprobed while Bolsonaro has been jailed for a coup he plotted in the same year. If those who attempted to force Abeywardena to resort to an illegal course of action had succeeded in their endeavour, this country would have descended into anarchy. There is no guarantee that the same sinister forces will not make a fresh attempt to achieve their goal, and create conditions for another uprising. Hence the need for Abeywardena\u2019s claim to be investigated thoroughly and action taken against those who were behind the 2022 \u2018conspiracy\u2019. It may be recalled that ousted Prime Minister of Bangladesh Sheikh Hasina has also alleged that there was a foreign hand behind the uprising that toppled her government last year.\n\nDoomed is the nation that has not a single MP to call for a probe into a conspiracy to destabilise it.\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
