    "description": "From marginalised voices to model UN champions: Sri Lankan youth break barriers at SLMUN 2025",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/from-marginalised-voices-to-model-un-champions-sri-lankan-youth-break-barriers-at-slmun-2025/",
    "lang": "en",
