    "chunk_size_bytes": 329,
    "chunk_text": "For the purposes of debt repayment only a sinking fund (externally invested for particular debt especially in small countries) or a sovereign wealth fund which is divorced from reserve money can be used.\n\nUsing monetary reserves for third party private imports via a suppressed policy rate is a strict no-no. (Colombo/Aug16/2025)"
