    "description": "Several spells of showers expected in parts of the island",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/112499/several-spells-of-showers-expected-in-parts-of-the-island",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
