    "description": "Israel intensifies Gaza City bombing as Rubio arrives",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/112510/israel-intensifies-gaza-city-bombing-as-rubio-arrives",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
