    "description": "Rs. 2000 currency note will be gradually introduced into the banking system: CBSL",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/112518/rs-2000-currency-note-will-be-gradually-introduced-into-the-banking-system-cbsl",
    "lang": "en",
