    "description": "Another suspected \u2018Ice\u2019 production facility uncovered in Hambantota",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/112519/another-suspected-ice-production-facility-uncovered-in-hambantota",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
