    "description": "Duplantis Breaks World Pole Vault Record With 6.30m In Tokyo",
    "url_metadata": "https://english.newsfirst.lk/2025/09/16/duplantis-breaks-world-pole-vault-record-with-6-30m-in-tokyo",
    "lang": "en",
