    "description": "Britain to roll out red carpet, royal fanfare for Trump visit",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/112560/britain-to-roll-out-red-carpet-royal-fanfare-for-trump-visit",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
