    "date_str": "2025-09-17",
    "description": "EDB and Germany\u2019s Import Promotion Desk to expand cooperation",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/EDB-and-Germany-s-Import-Promotion-Desk-to-expand-cooperation/34-781771",
