    "chunk_text": "The Sri Lanka FinTech Summit will operationalise our agenda via a National Fintech Roadmap that specifies reforms, responsibilities, and measurable milestones. Broad stakeholder engagement is essential to deliver results within the coming year. In parallel, the Summit will target FDI and strategic partnerships and advance public understanding of fintech\u2019s role in expanding access to services.\n\nIf we execute on this agenda together, Government laying the rails, banks providing the stability, fintechs supplying the innovation, and citizens shaping adoption; Sri Lanka can position itself not merely as a participant in the global digital economy, but as a key player in its next wave of growth."
