    "date_str": "2025-09-17",
    "description": "Consultation conundrum: How \u2018people friendly\u2019 is the Government?",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Consultation-conundrum-How-people-friendly-is-the-Government/4-781782",
