    "description": "Cabinet directs to gazette and table revised Social Security Contribution Levy Bill for Parliament approval",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Cabinet-directs-to-gazette-and-table-revised-Social-Security-Contribution-Levy-Bill-for-Parliament-approval/56-781788",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
