    "description": "Digitalization, SME support & new insurance schemes highlighted in pre-budget talks with banking sector",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/112592/digitalization-sme-support-new-insurance-schemes-highlighted-in-pre-budget-talks-with-banking-sector",
    "lang": "en",
