    "description": "\u2018Clear Quartz\u2019 illegally exported from Sri Lanka, COPE inquiry finds",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/112617/clear-quartz-illegally-exported-from-sri-lanka-cope-inquiry-finds",
