    "description": "Air India crash victims\u2019 families sue aerospace firms Boeing and Honeywell",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/112646/air-india-crash-victims-families-sue-aerospace-firms-boeing-and-honeywell",
    "lang": "en",
