    "description": "\u2018Disrupt Asia 2025\u2019 aims to unlock Sri Lanka as South Asia\u2019s innovation hub",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/112652/disrupt-asia-2025-aims-to-unlock-sri-lanka-as-south-asias-innovation-hub",
