    "description": "Hayleys Fentons\u2019 Managing Director honoured at inaugural CPM Management Leadership Excellence Awards 2025",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Hayleys-Fentons-Managing-Director-honoured-at-inaugural-CPM-Management-Leadership-Excellence-Awards-2025/34-781884",
