    "md5": "c2046d0dab7423df2825a76661521b9a",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1452,
    "chunk_text": "Hayleys Fentons\u2019 Managing Director honoured at inaugural CPM Management Leadership Excellence Awards 2025\n\nHasith Prematillake \u2013 Executive Director level Winner across Power and Energy (Renewable); Construction, Condominium and Real Estate; Project and Engineering; and First Runner-Up in Sustainability and Circular Economy\n\nHayleys Fentons Ltd. Managing Director Hasith Prematillake, received four exemplary recognitions at the inaugural CPM Management Leadership Excellence (MLE) Awards 2025.\n\nOrganised by the Institute of Chartered Professional Managers of Sri Lanka (CPM Sri Lanka), the Awards honoured Sri Lanka\u2019s most outstanding leaders who demonstrate \u201cvision, resilience and excellence in management practices.\u201d\n\nAt the event, Prematillake received multiple top honours at the Executive Director level, emerging as the Winner in Power and Energy (Renewable), Construction, Condominium and Real Estate, and Project and Engineering categories. He also earned recognition as the First Runner-Up in the Special Category of Sustainability and Circular Economy, underscoring his leadership in driving innovation, responsibility, and future-focused business practices.\n\nWith over 20 years of senior leadership across diverse industries, Prematillake, one of Sri Lanka\u2019s leading corporate personalities, currently serves as the Managing Director of Hayleys Fentons Ltd. and its subsidiaries, bringing deep expertise and strategic vision."
  },
