    "chunk_text": "Guided by Prematillake\u2019s sustainability-first vision, Hayleys Fentons has become a vanguard of renewable energy in Sri Lanka. Hayleys Solar, the company\u2019s flagship energy venture, now leads the market and is on track to become the first local company to achieve over 500 MW in installed capacity by the end of 2025, focusing on utility-scale solar and innovative solar solutions that enhance land productivity and sustainable agriculture. He has also led the company\u2019s successful bid for Sri Lanka\u2019s largest wind power plant, expanded regional operations and advanced battery storage and circular energy solutions through strategic partnerships and inclusive financing models."
  },
  {
    "doc_type": "lk_news",
