    "description": "Deputy Foreign Ministers of Sri Lanka & Ukraine hold phone call on boosting bilateral ties",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/112672/deputy-foreign-ministers-of-sri-lanka-ukraine-hold-phone-call-on-boosting-bilateral-ties",
    "lang": "en",
