    "description": "Sri Lanka\u2019s third nano-satellite successfully deployed into orbit",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/112687/sri-lankas-third-nano-satellite-successfully-deployed-into-orbit-",
    "lang": "en",
