    "description": "Response to Mahinda Rajapaksa: It is  not personal revenge or political terrorism",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Response-to-Mahinda-Rajapaksa-It-is-not-personal-revenge-or-political-terrorism/4-781933",
    "lang": "en",
