    "description": "South Asia Policy and Research Institute holds first of youth-led series of dialogues",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/South-Asia-Policy-and-Research-Institute-holds-first-of-youth-led-series-of-dialogues/56-781951",
    "lang": "en",
