    "description": "Drug shortage stems from procurement issues, not financial constraints \u2013 Health Minister",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/112716/drug-shortage-stems-from-procurement-issues-not-financial-constraints-health-minister",
    "lang": "en",
