    "description": "Pentagon imposes new restrictions on media covering the US military",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/112717/pentagon-imposes-new-restrictions-on-media-covering-the-us-military",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
