    "chunk_text": "Brandix crowned Sri Lanka\u2019s leading corporate blood donor for 13th consecutive year\n\nBrandix, Sri Lanka\u2019s premier apparel exporter, has once again been recognized as the country\u2019s Largest Corporate Blood Donor, a title it has now held for an unprecedented 13 consecutive years. The award was presented by Prime Minister Dr. Harini Amarasuriya at the World Blood Donor Day celebrations, honouring the group\u2019s 16th Annual Group Blood Drive.\n\nThe scale of Brandix\u2019s contribution is transformative.\u00a0Since the inception of its annual blood drive, Brandix has donated a total of 47,655 pints of blood, directly benefiting over 142,965 patients across the country with the \u2018gift of life\u2019.\u00a0In 2024 alone, the group added 2,371 pints to the National Blood Bank, reinforcing its vital partnership with the National Blood Transfusion Service (NBTS).\n\nThis achievement underscores a remarkable level of associate participation. With one in every 100 blood donors in Sri Lanka being a member of the Brandix community.\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
