    "description": "UK, Canada and Australia recognise Palestinian state in major diplomatic shift",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/112741/uk-canada-and-australia-recognise-palestinian-state-in-major-diplomatic-shift",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
    "time_ut": 1758460800.0,
