    "description": "Phoenix rising: How Colombo Stock Exchange symbolises nation\u2019s remarkable resurrection",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Phoenix-rising-How-Colombo-Stock-Exchange-symbolises-nation-s-remarkable-resurrection/4-781989",
