    "description": "President Dissanayake to undertake an official visit to Japan",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/112752/president-dissanayake-to-undertake-an-official-visit-to-japan",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
