    "description": "Global trade volumes slow in 2Q25 on tariff impacts: Fitch Ratings",
    "url_metadata": "https://economynext.com/global-trade-volumes-slow-in-2q25-on-tariff-impacts-fitch-ratings-241477/",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "economynextcom",
