    "description": "\u0db8\u0dbb\u0dab \u0dad\u0dd4\u0db1\u0dd9\u0db1\u0dca \u0dc4\u0db8\u0dd4 \u0dc0\u0dd6 \u0dad\u0d82\u0d9c\u0dbd\u0dca\u0dbd\u0dd9\u0dca \u0d9a\u0dd4\u0da9\u0dd4 \u0d9a\u0db1\u0dca\u0daf | \u0dc0\u0dd3\u0da9\u0dd2\u0dba\u0ddd",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.lankadeepa.lk/news/%E0%B6%B8%E0%B6%BB%E0%B6%AB-%E0%B6%AD%E0%B7%94%E0%B6%B1%E0%B7%99%E0%B6%B1%E0%B7%8A-%E0%B7%84%E0%B6%B8%E0%B7%94-%E0%B7%80%E0%B7%96-%E0%B6%AD%E0%B6%82%E0%B6%9C%E0%B6%BD%E0%B7%8A%E0%B6%BD%E0%B7%99%E0%B7%8A-%E0%B6%9A%E0%B7%94%E0%B6%A9%E0%B7%94-%E0%B6%9A%E0%B6%B1%E0%B7%8A%E0%B6%AF-%7C-%E0%B7%80%E0%B7%93%E0%B6%A9%E0%B7%92%E0%B6%BA%E0%B7%9D/101-680011",
