    "description": "UK considers plan to scrap visa fees for top global talent: Report",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/112768/uk-considers-plan-to-scrap-visa-fees-for-top-global-talent-report",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
    "time_ut": 1758528660.0,
