    "description": "245kg of heroin, 380kg of ICE and six weapons recovered in Tangalle today - Police",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/112779/245kg-of-heroin-380kg-of-ice-and-six-weapons-recovered-in-tangalle-today-police",
    "lang": "en",
