    "chunk_text": "President Dissanayake assured that no employee will face a reduction in salary or position, employee rights will be fully protected, any unresolved matters involving the CEB will be addressed before integration into the new entities and all existing rights and assets of the CEB will be secured under the new structure.\n\nThe meeting also featured extensive discussions on the challenges and suggestions related to the reform process."
