    "description": "Digitalisation or dependency? Sri Lanka\u2019s AI dilemma beyond AKD\u2019s binary",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Digitalisation-or-dependency-Sri-Lanka-s-AI-dilemma-beyond-AKD-s-binary/4-782027",
