    "chunk_text": "Network Sri Lanka\u2019s participation at the UN PSF is more than an international appearance \u2013 it is a signal that Sri Lanka is engaging with the world at a critical juncture, determined to contribute to and benefit from the global transition toward sustainability.\n\nThrough this engagement, Network Sri Lanka seeks to inspire more Sri Lankan businesses to align with global sustainability standards, deepen partnerships across sectors, and position Sri Lanka as a credible partner in the global effort to build a just, inclusive, and thriving future."
