    "description": "X-Press Pearl Disaster: Singapore firm rejects US$1 billion Sri Lankan fine for pollution damages",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/112806/x-press-pearl-disaster-singapore-firm-rejects-us1-billion-sri-lankan-fine-for-pollution-damages",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
