    "description": "Two persons linked to yesterday\u2019s Tangalle drugs seizure arrested",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/112819/two-persons-linked-to-yesterdays-tangalle-drugs-seizure-arrested-",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
