    "description": "Fertilizer subsidy to farmers worth Rs. 200M to be provided via QR code \u2013 Minister",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/112820/fertilizer-subsidy-to-farmers-worth-rs-200m-to-be-provided-via-qr-code-minister",
    "lang": "en",
