    "chunk_text": "The grant agreement was formally signed today by Dr. Harshana Suriyapperuma, Secretary to the Ministry of Finance, Planning and Economic Development, on behalf of the government and Carmen Moreno, Ambassador of the European Union to Sri Lanka, on behalf of the EU.\n\nThe Secretary of the Ministry of Finance, Planning and Economic Development expressed sincere appreciation to the European Union for its valuable support, noting that the project aligns closely with Sri Lanka\u201ds sustainable development agenda and its dedication to protecting biodiversity."
