    "description": "Women\u2019s World Cup Trophy Lands in Colombo with Style",
    "url_metadata": "https://english.newsfirst.lk/2025/09/23/women%e2%80%99s-world-cup-trophy-lands-in-colombo-with-style",
    "lang": "en",
