    "description": "Trump hits Russia, backs Israel in wide-ranging UN speech",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.adaderana.lk/news/112840/trump-hits-russia-backs-israel-in-wide-ranging-un-speech",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "adaderanalk",
